## Verification

1. Build: `cd MacOSX && xcodebuild -project QuakeSpasm.xcodeproj -scheme QSS-M -configuration Debug build`
2. Launch, load a map (`map e1m1`)
3. `mapsize` → verify floor/wall/ceiling/total in sq ft
4. `mapsize metric` → verify output in sq m
5. `mapsize` with no map → verify "no map loaded"
6. Load a different map → verify numbers change
7. Start a dedicated server → verify `mapsize` reads from `qcvm->worldmodel`
